    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Orchestrator Service Logs",
      "description": "سجلات orchestrator-service الحية (يتطلب Loki)",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 40, "w": 24, "h": 8 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{job=\"orchestrator-service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Step 3 — Activation Guide",
      "description": "دليل تفعيل الخطوة الانتقالية الثالثة",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 48, "w": 24, "h": 6 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 🚀 الخطوة الانتقالية الثالثة — Live Activation\n\n### تشغيل الـ Stack\n```bash\n# عبر Ona automations\ngitpod automations service start orchestrator-stack\n\n# أو مباشرة\ndocker compose -f docker-compose.step3.yml up -d\n```\n\n### التحقق الحي\n```bash\n# Health check\ncurl http://localhost:8006/health | python3 -m json.tool\n\n# Metrics\ncurl http://localhost:8006/metrics | grep cogniforge_\n\n# Ona task\ngitpod automations task start health-probe\n```\n\n### الخدمات المُفعَّلة\n| الخدمة | المنفذ | الحالة |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| orchestrator-service | 8006 | 🟢 ACTIVE (Step 3) |\n| postgres-orchestrator | 5441 | 🟢 ACTIVE |\n| redis-orchestrator | 6380 | 🟢 ACTIVE |\n| FastAPI monolith | 8000 | 🟢 ACTIVE (always) |\n| Grafana | 3001 | 🟢 ACTIVE (always) |\n| Prometheus | 9090 | 🟢 ACTIVE (always) |"
      }
    }
  ]
}
